OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist, 43, killed in crash
OL,4,Aon busy route
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist has died in a crash with
OL,7,Fa car on a major route in south
OL,8,FOxfordshire.
OL,10,FThe collision involving a red Honda CBR
OL,11,F1000 motorcycle and a grey Audi A3
OL,12,Fhappened on the A4074 Reading Road at
OL,13,FCane End at about 15:20 BST on Sunday.
OL,15,FThe rider of the motorcycle - a
OL,16,F43-year-old man - was pronounced dead
OL,17,Fat the scene. His next of kin have been
OL,18,Finformed.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
